		(uuid "080203ce-55c0-4893-a16d-acfa45fabcae")
	)
	(text "  advertisement (Rp/CC voltage band per USB-PD/Type-C spec). CC1/CC2 above this level means the host is advertising"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0a6679a0-81b6-4794-bee2-6d187a1f0a73")
	)
	(text "- R_EN sizing is not a guess: SN6505B EN leakage is 20 uA max against a 0.7*VCC threshold, so R_EN <="
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 194 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2452fdbe-1597-4f94-b0c7-a4070be1d7fd")
	)
	(text "- Status LED D2 lights on INSUFFICIENT host power: Q2's gate reads CC_DET_L directly (already active-high for"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 207 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3002c04b-3e3e-4b72-bd40-719196c3e12c")
	)
	(text "- Comparators (U3, TLV7042) are wired INVERTING: CC -> IN-, V_REF -> IN+. Open-drain outputs OUTA/OUTB wire-OR onto"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 44.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3106a329-3468-4554-86c1-391eb4f834be")
	)
	(text "  0.3*VBUS(min)/20uA = 71k. R6 = 10k gives EN ~4.55 V against a 3.325 V threshold (1.225 V margin). 100k here would"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 199 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3c727086-f304-4651-b42b-b1410f24c982")
	)
	(text "  construction."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 30 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "427e0b25-e6d6-4259-ac03-59817206e92f")
	)
	(text "- Q1 (2N7002) inverts CC_DET_L to drive HOST_PWR_OK active-high: gate=CC_DET_L, source=GND1, drain=HOST_PWR_OK, pulled"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 188 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a2145df-bc8c-490a-980e-708d624fc912")
	)
	(text "  up by R_EN (R6) to VBUS_HOST. HOST_PWR_OK feeds SN6505B.EN in Task 5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 191 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4d2e38f8-98d9-4268-921d-9470f1adfbef")
	)
	(text "- The reference MUST stay on VBUS_HOST, never on an isolated rail or anything downstream of EN/HOST_PWR_OK. The"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5fc2f1b3-e1ce-4d18-93cc-612cdffcd181")
	)
	(text "  OR only needs ONE CC line correct to assert. A false trigger here never asserts on a low-power host."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "764c62af-afb9-48c1-a728-189902e6500e")
	)
	(text "- On an e-marked cable, one CC line carries VCONN at ~5 V, which reads as a false high (>0.66 V) at the unused"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "77719be2-8a31-4844-8630-ffad3da4f358")
	)
	(text "  >=1.5 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "90a85de0-cef3-42d8-815e-7c7e893f324c")
	)
	(text "CC current-advertisement sensing (GND1) -- design notes:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b21749e4-e7d7-4e85-9c92-c8c1cfcda989")
	)
	(text "  comparator input. This is benign: VCONN only appears alongside cables/sources rated for high current, and the wire-"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b229aabd-3dda-4aca-872e-9a375aeadc9f")
	)
	(text "  insufficient, no extra inverter needed) and sinks D2+R9 from VBUS_HOST when on."
